      {
        "finding": "EMSO, the best non-collapsed method, leaves substantial memorization while keeping utility. On GPT-Neo-2.7B, MA goes from 0.789 to 0.615 with MAUVE 0.610 (Table 1). The authors note some requests remain incompletely erased, and erasure gets harder at larger scale. No rows record EMSO, DI, TA or CD.",
        "proposed_claim": "Utility-preserving verbatim-memorization erasure is incomplete and weakens with model scale.",
