    "problems": "The study evaluates verbatim textual-sequence memorization rather than targeted knowledge. It reports no post-unlearning recovery attacks. Table 1 provides point values without uncertainty estimates; the paper describes collapse for GA and related methods.",
    "rows_left_out": "No results for other Table 1 methods are included: the recorded rows focus on the directly named gradient-ascent method. The paper's comparisons of other erasure methods and EMSO do not test any listed recovery version; the ablation and reasoning evaluations likewise do not measure recovery after unlearning.",
